{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820730/extras/obr1.jpg?t=1735178325\" />Space Combat Simulator is a spacecraft action simulator. Choose one of dozens of ships to complete many dangerous missions across the solar system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take part in epic battles, conquer bases and destroy large battleships</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- a choice of ships</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- the ability to control large battlecruisers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- a variety of missions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- New locations, planet surfaces, urban combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- local co-op</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- base combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse locations:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Mars, Venus, Earth, Mercury, Pluto</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Combined orbital missions, possibly looking at the surface of a planet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Known moons Io, Europa</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Visit exoplanets</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2820730?t=1735178325","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820730/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1735178325","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820730/9050cc04cf048821707f2ccb2328ac5cb1a8084c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1735178325","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820730/9050cc04cf048821707f2ccb2328ac5cb1a8084c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1735178325","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":